Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 10:17:23 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 13/14] Blaze: add Stats component with getKeyScopesMap (shared
 EA Sports)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

New wire component 7 = Stats, routing getKeyScopesMap (15) to a typed
KeyScopes{KSIT: map<string,KeyScopeItem>} reply instead of the generic
empty fallback. The EA Sports client's Stats manager dereferences the
KSIT field unconditionally; a reply without it is a null-deref risk.
Shared across all EA Sports titles (NHL/Madden/FIFA), part of the base
template.

Note: NHL 15's "Retrieving data from server" PPU crash (null-deref at
0x008b1aec, a 'stgm' subsystem lookup returning null) is NOT fixed by
this and is independent of the getKeyScopesMap response content —
needs EBOOT disassembly to identify the 'stgm' data the game expects.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
